WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:01.500
Hello, everyone.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Can you say hello?

3
00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:05.400
Hello.

4
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:11.940
Great job.

5
00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:14.740
I'm Jot. Nice to meet you.

6
00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:16.660
What's your name?

7
00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:23.320
Nice to meet you.

8
00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:28.120
Today, we're learning how to greet our friends. Let's begin.

9
00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:29.320
I'm here,

10
00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:33.040
and you're here. But where are the rest of our friends?

11
00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:40.000
Hello, Tail.

12
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:44.300
We say hello when we see someone.

13
00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:46.220
Listen first.

14
00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:48.360
Hello.

15
00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:53.500
Now, let's say it together. Hello.

16
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:01.060
Good job.

17
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.260
Let's do a big hello.

18
00:01:04.819 --> 00:01:05.340
Hello.

19
00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:15.880
Wonderful.

20
00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:22.540
Hello, I'm Echo.

21
00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:26.820
Hello, Echo. I'm Tail. Nice to meet you.

22
00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:29.140
Nice to meet you, too.

23
00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:34.040
When we meet a new friend, we say, "Nice to meet you."

24
00:01:35.020 --> 00:01:36.280
Now, let's say it together.

25
00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:37.840
Nice to meet you.

26
00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:46.160
Well done.

27
00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:48.620
What can you say to Echo?

28
00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:57.600
Nice to meet you, too.

29
00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:01.500
Hello, I'm Boom.

30
00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:11.260
Oh, it's time to go.

31
00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:13.260
See you.

32
00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:17.300
See you, Boom.

33
00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:21.420
We say see you when someone goes away.

34
00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:24.360
Listen first. See you.

35
00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:27.280
Now, let's say it together.

36
00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:29.000
See you.

37
00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:36.820
Nice work.

38
00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:41.640
Okay, everyone. Let's practice together.

39
00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:46.480
Hello, I'm Jot.

40
00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.020
Hello, I'm Tail.

41
00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:50.660
Nice to meet you.

42
00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:52.660
Nice to meet you, too.

43
00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:57.380
Now it's your turn. Tail is meeting you.

44
00:02:58.300 --> 00:02:59.620
Hello, I'm Tail.

45
00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:01.980
Say, "Hello, Tail."

46
00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:10.260
What do you say?

47
00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:18.860
Nice to meet you, too.

48
00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:20.480
Excellent.

49
00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:24.560
We can greet the friends in your classroom, too.

50
00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:27.420
First, watch me.

51
00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:29.840
Hello, Boom.

52
00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:32.720
Hello, Jot.

53
00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:37.120
Now, look around your classroom. Can you see a friend?

54
00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:38.820
Did you find them?

55
00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:43.960
Now wave and say, "Hello."

56
00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:50.140
Great job.

57
00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:52.700
Shall we play a game with Tail?

58
00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:54.820
I'm Tail.

59
00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:57.720
It's quiz time.

60
00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:01.200
Watch carefully and tell me what we say.

61
00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:08.740
Jot is coming into the classroom. Do we say hello

62
00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:10.800
or see you?

63
00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:17.981
That's right.

64
00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:20.279
We say hello.

65
00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:23.740
Let's do another one.

66
00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:30.160
Echo is meeting a new friend. What does she say?

67
00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:32.040
Is it see you,

68
00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:34.580
or is it nice to meet you?

69
00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:43.880
That's right. She says, "Nice to meet you."

70
00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:47.600
Okay, let's do one more.

71
00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:53.660
Boom is going home. What do we say?

72
00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:56.000
Is it see you,

73
00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:58.460
or is it hello?

74
00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:06.840
Yes, see you.

75
00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:13.300
Let's play a memory game. Look at our friends.

76
00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:16.000
There's Jot,

77
00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:17.800
Echo,

78
00:05:19.140 --> 00:05:19.700
and Boom.

79
00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:22.200
One of them is going to disappear.

80
00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:24.900
Close your eyes, no peeking.

81
00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:27.620
Three, two,

82
00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:30.040
one, open your eyes.

83
00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:31.780
Who is missing?

84
00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:41.340
Hello.

85
00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:43.680
It was Boom. Hello, Boom.

86
00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:45.440
Hello, everyone.

87
00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:47.400
Let's play again.

88
00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:51.940
Close your eyes. Three, two, one.

89
00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:54.280
Who is missing now?

90
00:06:02.060 --> 00:06:04.200
I'm going now. See you.

91
00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:07.460
It was Echo. What do we say to Echo?

92
00:06:09.910 --> 00:06:10.310
You.

93
00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:13.890
Wow, you have a great memory.

94
00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:18.570
Hello, everyone. I'm Boom.

95
00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:22.650
It's time to stand up.

96
00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:27.370
Are you ready?

97
00:06:30.050 --> 00:06:30.930
Let's move.

98
00:06:32.110 --> 00:06:34.750
When you hear "hello," wave your hands.

99
00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:37.470
Hello.

100
00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:46.170
Now you try. Hello.

101
00:06:56.730 --> 00:07:00.630
Very nice waving. Now, let's do a big hello.

102
00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:02.450
Hello.

103
00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:11.990
Whoa, great work, everyone. Next, when you hear,

104
00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:14.710
"Nice to meet you," do an air handshake.

105
00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:17.790
Nice to meet you.

106
00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:24.950
Now you try. Nice to meet you.

107
00:07:25.470 --> 00:07:27.570
Hello. Would you like to shake hands?

108
00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:30.670
Hands.

109
00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:38.770
Fantastic. Next, when you hear, "See you,"

110
00:07:39.190 --> 00:07:41.530
take one small step back and wave.

111
00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:44.150
See you.

112
00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:49.210
Now you try.

113
00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:50.850
See you.

114
00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:03.670
Whoa, great work, everyone.

115
00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:07.430
Hello, everyone. I'm Echo.

116
00:08:08.690 --> 00:08:12.610
You did a wonderful job today. Let's remember our three

117
00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:13.330
phrases.

118
00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:17.630
Jot sees his friends. What does he say?

119
00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:24.630
Hello.

120
00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:26.370
That's right.

121
00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:30.830
Boom made a new friend.

122
00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:32.610
What does she say?

123
00:08:38.211 --> 00:08:40.390
Nice to meet you. Well done.

124
00:08:42.691 --> 00:08:44.270
Tail is going home.

125
00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:45.930
What does he say?

126
00:08:51.870 --> 00:08:52.450
See you.

127
00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:55.270
You remembered everything.

128
00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:02.650
Thank you for learning with us.

129
00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:04.850
Great speaking.

130
00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:06.230
Great thing.

131
00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:08.330
Great moving.

132
00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:12.230
It's time to go. What do we say?

133
00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:19.970
See you.
